(TITLE: Orvan wheat: the sea loss is real, the substitutes are small) Tj
T*
(SOURCE_NAME: Tide Research) Tj
T*
(SOURCE_TYPE: analyst_note) Tj
T*
(RELIABILITY: 3) Tj
T*
(PUB_DATE: 2026-10-22) Tj
T*
